    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>EmailBody_Customer_DuplicateCase</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Dear {!$Record.Customer_Name__c},

Thank you for reaching Modon Services regarding the issue you are facing. We have created case {!$Record.CaseNumber} to address your concern. However, we are closing this case as we already have an open case {!$Record.Parent.CaseNumber} for the same concern.

We are actively working on your open case and we assure your case will be addressed at the earliest with prompt resolution.

Best Regards,
Modon Service Team</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>EmailBody_Customer_Notification</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Dear {!$Record.Customer_Name__c},

Thank you for reaching Modon Services regarding the issue you are facing. We have created a case to address your concern.

Account Name       :  {!$Record.Account_Name__c}
Issue Description    :  {!$Record.Description}
Case Number         :  {!$Record.CaseNumber}
Category                :  {!$Record.CaseCategory__c}
Sub Category         :  {!$Record.CaseSubCategory__c}
Primary Owner       :  {!$Record.Primary_Owner_Name__c}
Parent Case            :  {!$Record.ParentId}
Date Created          :  {!$Record.CreatedDate}

Your case will be addressed at the earliest with prompt resolution.

Best Regards,
Modon Service Team</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>EmailBody_Customer_Outside_BHours</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Dear {!$Record.Customer_Name__c},

Thank you for reaching Modon Services regarding the issue you are facing. We have created a case to address your concern. Please note that your case is received outside our business hours and will be taken up during the next immediate working hours.

Case Number       :  {!$Record.CaseNumber}
Issue Description  :  {!$Record.Description}
Category               :  {!$Record.CaseCategory__c}
Sub Category       :  {!$Record.CaseSubCategory__c}
Date Created        :  {!$Record.CreatedDate}

Your case will be addressed at the earliest with prompt resolution.

Best Regards,
Modon Service Team</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
